# Plan review before implementation

Unless the change is **truly trivial** (see [iterative-plan-review.md](../../referenceFiles/SOPs/iterative-plan-review.md)):

1. **Draft** using [.cursor/skills/implementation-plan/SKILL.md](../skills/implementation-plan/SKILL.md)
2. **Invoke** [`plan-reviewer`](../agents/plan-reviewer.md) with `model: composer-2.5` on every pass (max 3); full synthesized plan each time (no prior review transcripts)
3. **Synthesize** between passes — fix blockers; capture uncertainties as **discovery steps**
4. **Present** to user after pass 3 or early `APPROVED`; if `CHANGES REQUESTED`, surface **outstanding requested changes** and **wait for user** before another loop or Agent mode

During implementation, each plan phase ends with the [iterative code review](./iterative-code-review.mdc) loop before the next phase starts.
